{"steam_appid":466560,"steam_name":"Northgard: Definitive Edition","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/466560/1274293776/142603b333d49be18b3b0ca6fa1cfd6769e86799/1764777602/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764864169","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257242927/d6a361f95afd81ded94b027ca8cde54d89be141c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764864169","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/ss_eb6ecfd37f68dc5cadabf603c4ab890d2a545730.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791208167","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/e2677588df00827df20758e56f96a825f0f741fd/ss_e2677588df00827df20758e56f96a825f0f741fd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791208167","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/5452d42c32e21f999d2f2e29e312653d2344294d/ss_5452d42c32e21f999d2f2e29e312653d2344294d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791208167","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/e71a1c785c3864a22b2d507e3e511f2e15368812/ss_e71a1c785c3864a22b2d507e3e511f2e15368812.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791208167","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/ss_13fc33e3ad933bac47419d80892ebaabfe502d8b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791208167"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/b650472c5bbda6087a348c0d03142ef7.avif?t=1791208167\" width=614 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/01722e93d4d5f518932695b59db5eb68.poster.avif?t=1791208167\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/01722e93d4d5f518932695b59db5eb68.webm?t=1791208167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/01722e93d4d5f518932695b59db5eb68.mp4?t=1791208167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After years of tireless exploration, brave Vikings have discovered a new land filled with mystery, danger and riches: Northgard. The boldest Northmen have set sail to explore and conquer these new shores, bring fame to their Clan and write history through conquest, trading, or devotion to the Gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/fb9ff220cd1d71ab9328a86383c812c3.avif?t=1791208167\" width=614 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/1a36d8a354054e9f4bb3bc8cadd694d3.poster.avif?t=1791208167\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/1a36d8a354054e9f4bb3bc8cadd694d3.webm?t=1791208167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/1a36d8a354054e9f4bb3bc8cadd694d3.mp4?t=1791208167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your settlement on the newly discovered continent of Northgard! Assign your Vikings to various jobs and manage your resources carefully to survive harsh winters and ferocious foes. Expand your clan strategically by chasing conquest, fame, lore or trade victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/901d89c58c0075419dffe36d36809151.avif?t=1791208167\" width=614 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/c73e8bb6bb37126e3856d1c51aea2ad2.poster.avif?t=1791208167\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/c73e8bb6bb37126e3856d1c51aea2ad2.webm?t=1791208167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/c73e8bb6bb37126e3856d1c51aea2ad2.mp4?t=1791208167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Survive and conquer the unforgiving wilderness of Northgard by mastering the unique attributes of the many different clans that inhabit the continent! Each clan has its own unique specificities, bonuses and features, introducing new ways of playing and methods to achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/aab836540cb962cb5f149f5a9aaa21db.avif?t=1791208167\" width=614 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/a87bd287e06ad1230d15a2c29ca483c0.poster.avif?t=1791208167\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/a87bd287e06ad1230d15a2c29ca483c0.webm?t=1791208167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/a87bd287e06ad1230d15a2c29ca483c0.mp4?t=1791208167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Conquest mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose your clan and fight through a number of unique scenarios and situations! Northgard Conquest is a standalone game mode that can be played solo or co-op, with a succession of various challenges offering a gaming expansion of +100 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/88d3794bff336a34dc06bf5d6eef79d5.avif?t=1791208167\" width=614 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/2adb831e8e331961fefacc3c83b764eb.poster.avif?t=1791208167\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/2adb831e8e331961fefacc3c83b764eb.webm?t=1791208167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/2adb831e8e331961fefacc3c83b764eb.mp4?t=1791208167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Multiplayer mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play in multiplayer with or against your friends in various game modes! Pick the lobby you want and face off against other players to experience a unique level of challenges. If you’re a veteran at the game, test your might in ranked lobbies to prove you’re the real king of Northgard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/20fd87a0590aba3ae9addfecb378f2de.avif?t=1791208167\" width=614 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/1d5650caf742ce4241f6446c4651e054.poster.avif?t=1791208167\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/1d5650caf742ce4241f6446c4651e054.webm?t=1791208167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/466560/extras/1d5650caf742ce4241f6446c4651e054.mp4?t=1791208167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Viking High King is murdered and his Regal Horn is stolen by a man named Hagen. This event kickstarts a saga that will take Rig, his son and heir accompanied by his right-hand man Brand through the new continent of Northgard to discover the reasons behind his father’s assassination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Part II. Cross of Vidar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Separated and left with no choice after Ragnarök but to abandon their land, Rig, Liv and Svarn arrive in Neustria, land of the Southern Kingdoms, where they meet new leaders and become embroiled in a series of conflicts and alliances. </p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows Vista or better: 64 bits required<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 2.0ghz Core 2 Duo or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 450 GTS / Radeon HD 5750 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimum display resolution: 1366x768</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or better: 64 bits required<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 3.1 Ghz Quad core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 660 / Radeon HD 7800 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Recommended display resolution: 1440x900</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Shiro Games"],"publishers":["Shiro Games"],"release_date":"7 Mar, 2018","metacritic_score":81}